  "system": {
    "identifier": "inuzuka-fang-over-fang",
    "description": "<p>You spin at an accelerated rate chasing down enemies and slashing into them with each pass.</p>\n<p>As part of casting this jutsu, move up to your movement speed. You are able to pass through creatures spaces as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>Make a melee Taijutsu attack against each creature you pass through dealing your [Unarmed Damage] (or [Weapon Damage] if using a weapon) +4d6 and forcing them to make a Constitution saving throw, being Bruised on a failed save. A creature can only be attacked once as part of this jutsu’s casting.</p>\n<p>Tag-Team: Your Nin-Dog follows up with a spiraling cross similar to yours. They also get to move up to their movement speed, passing through creatures spaces. They also make a melee Taijutsu attack for each creature they pass through, dealing their Bite damage + 2d6. If the Nin-Dog deals damage to a creature that failed their saving throw, that creature is also Dazed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6 for both you and your Nin-Dog.</p>",
